message.content:
下面给出一组包含 **LLM function call** 的多轮对话示例（使用 `get_current_weather` 函数）。  
每条对话都以 JSON 数组的形式呈现，数组中的每个元素代表一次对话轮次，字段说明如下：

| 字段 | 说明 |
|------|------|
| `role` | 角色：`user`、`assistant` 或 `tool` |
| `content` | 对话内容（若为函数调用则置为 `null`） |
| `function_call` | 仅在 `assistant` 角色中出现，表示调用的函数信息 |
| `name` | 仅在 `tool` 角色中出现，表示返回的函数名称 |
| `arguments` | `function_call` 中的参数对象 |
| `result` | `tool` 角色中返回的函数结果对象 |

```json
[
  [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What's the weather like in San Francisco?"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": null,
      "function_call": {
        "name": "get_current_weather",
        "arguments": {
          "location": "San Francisco, CA",
          "unit": "celsius"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "tool",
      "name": "get_current_weather",
      "content": {
        "temperature": 18,
        "description": "Sunny",
        "humidity": 55
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "In San Francisco, it's currently 18°C with sunny skies and 55% humidity."
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Tell me the weather in Tokyo."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": null,
      "function_call": {
        "name": "get_current_weather",
        "arguments": {
          "location": "Tokyo, Japan",
          "unit": "fahrenheit"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "tool",
      "name": "get_current_weather",
      "content": {
        "temperature": 72,
        "description": "Cloudy",
        "humidity": 70
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "In Tokyo, it's 72°F, cloudy, with 70% humidity."
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Will it rain in London tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": null,
      "function_call": {
        "name": "get_current_weather",
        "arguments": {
          "location": "London, UK",
          "unit": "celsius"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "tool",
      "name": "get_current_weather",
      "content": {
        "temperature": 16,
        "description": "Rainy",
        "humidity": 80
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Tomorrow in London, expect 16°C, rainy, with 80% humidity."
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What's the weather in Seattle?"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": null,
      "function_call": {
        "name": "get_current_weather",
        "arguments": {
          "location": "Seattle, WA",
          "unit": "fahrenheit"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "tool",
      "name": "get_current_weather",
      "content": {
        "temperature": 58,
        "description": "Partly Cloudy",
        "humidity": 60
      }
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "In Seattle, it's 58°F, partly cloudy, with 60% humidity."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Do I need an umbrella?"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Yes, you might want an umbrella due to the chance of rain."
    }
  ]
]
```

> **说明**  
> - `function_call` 与 `tool` 消息遵循 OpenAI 的函数调用规范。  
> - `arguments` 与 `content` 均为 JSON 对象，便于后续解析。  
> - 以上示例仅演示了 `get_current_weather` 的使用，实际应用中可根据业务需求扩展更多函数。
